{{external|rs}}
'''Farming shops''' are a type of [[store]] throughout [[Gielinor]]. The stores are represented by a [[File:Farming shop icon.png]] icon. The majority of farming shops sell tools that players need to start [[Farming]], while some sell seeds. There are 13 Farming shops in ''Old School RuneScape''. Most are located near an [[Farming/Patch locations|allotment farming patch]].

